# Narset's Reversal: "Copy target instant or sorcery spell, then return it to its owner's hand. You may choose new targets
# for the copy." Bot1 casts Lightning Bolt at Bot2, then Reversal on it. The copy is made first (CR 707.10) and keeps
# Bot2 as its target; only then is the original returned to Bot1's hand (CR 400.3). Bot2 takes 3 from the copy, and the
# Bolt is in hand, not the graveyard (it was returned, not resolved or countered).
# Black Lotus pays {U}{U} for the Reversal, Mox Ruby the Bolt.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Narset's Reversal
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x12

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
